  {
   "id": "vvcqae",
   "name": "text",
   "parent": "dynhfl",
   "children": [],
   "settings": {
    "text": "<h3>Website Revitalization</h3><p>We redesigned the website for a cleaner UX/UI, ensured mobile optimization, and integrated conversion rate optimization (CRO) elements like clear CTAs and simplified checkout.</p><h3>Search Engine Optimization (SEO):</h3><p>We executed on-page SEO, created a content marketing calendar with educational blog posts, and addressed technical SEO issues like site speed.</p><h3>Targeted Digital Advertising:</h3><p>We launched highly targeted Google Ads and visually engaging social media campaigns on Instagram and Facebook, emphasizing EcoEssentials' unique selling propositions.</p>",
    "_cssGlobalClasses": [
     "srvbza"
